OL,3,GNEWSA'Have some respect,' - plea as
OL,4,Apark named after child killed in bomb
OL,5,Avandalised
OL,6,
OL,7,FA community worker has called on young
OL,8,Fpeople who vandalised a park named
OL,9,Fafter the youngest victim of the
OL,10,FShankill bombing to have a "bit of
OL,11,Frespect".
OL,13,FSeven-year-old Michelle Baird died
OL,14,Falongside her parents Michael 'Minnie'
OL,15,FMorrison and Evelyn Baird in the IRA
OL,16,Fbomb in 1993. Six other people, as well
OL,17,Fas one of the IRA bombers, were also
OL,18,Fkilled.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
