OL,3,GNEWSA'Have some respect,' - plea as
OL,4,Apark named after child killed in bomb
OL,5,Avandalised
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Michelle Baird Memorial Park in
OL,8,FGlencairn in Belfast has now had to
OL,9,Fclose due to ongoing vandalism from
OL,10,Fyoung people riding e-bikes and setting
OL,11,Foff fireworks.
OL,13,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,14,F(PSNI) said it was aware of concerns
OL,15,Faround anti-social behaviour in the
OL,16,FGlencairn area of the city.
